                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "amutulundulundu twamusokwe, Imbono zyako azintu zyako ziyandisi, zyoonse ndazipa kuti zibe zisaalo, azyalo zipaililo zyako zyakumalundu, nkaambo kazibi nzocitide moonse munyika yako, ",
