          "text": "O Jehova, bulangizi bwamusyobo wa-Israyeli, boonse bakutakata bayoofwa bweeme, Boonse baleya kuzwa kulinduwe bayoolembwa munyika, nkaambo Jehova ngubalekede nkekasensa kamaanzi aabuumi.",
