        },
        {
          "text": "Alimwi mutayumuni mukuli nuuba umwi kuzwa kumaanda aanu mubuzuba bwa-Sabata, nikuba kucita milimo niiba imwi. Amulemeke buzuba bwa-Sabata mbubonya mbundakabalailila bamausowanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
