                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "lino kulanjila mumilyango yamunzi oyu bami abasilutwe bakala acuuno cabwami bwa-Davida, batantide ankalaki ambizi, balo abanene babo, bantu ba-Juda abantu bakede mu-Jerusalemu, nkabela oyu munzi uyookalwa bantu lyoonse akutamani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.25",
