        {
          "text": "Pele na mwakaka kundiswiilila, na mwakaka kulemeka buzuba bwa-Sabata akulikasya kunjizya mikuli mumilyango ya-Jerusalemu mubuzuba bwa-Sabata, lino njooyasya mulilo mumilyango yawo, uyoolidilila maanda aabwami aamu-Jerusalemu, nkabela takukooyooba sikuuzimya.",
